{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111160015873-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111160641\"/><p>莊士敦道爆水管黃泥水湧出地面。</p><p>今午(11日)3時40分，灣仔莊士敦道181號大有商場對開行車路，地底一條水管突然爆裂，黃泥水夾住沙石湧出路面。水向低流淹浸莊士敦道東行慢線及行人路，途人因而望水卻步，未能走過行人路。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.190136+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:00:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:18.617526+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:18.617526+00:00","content_hash":"968b544254a242209a8653d8e1192f305eca5dc3aa580951baef542e5e2f7a8f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}